On available
    Say "As Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] said, we have turned the corner but it still looks very bad. Shouldn't we just fight the boss? Hehe."

On offer
    Show quest "An instruction from above. Looks like they want to resolve this situation.\n\nOne more devil to seal! It's the [6Devil] Duke Valefor, the god of thieves. Be careful, this man's got bad habit of stealing. Take the [6Devil Sommon Scroll] to [6Devil Summon Stone] in [Eslant]. Summon and eliminate him there.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 6 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Seis, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 6] Valefor from [Devil 6 Summoning Stone] at El Morad Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 6 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "The [6Devil] Valefor's touch just doesn't know how to stop."

On claimable
    Show quest "The [6Devil] Valefor's touch has finally stopped.Thank you.\n\nIt's [29Devil] Astaroth, the archduke of the underworld. As you are well-aware of it, he is a powerful devil so be careful. With him are [53Devil] Camio and he is not too be taken lightly, either. Stay focus!"
